# AI tooling — local only. The skills themselves live in packages/move/skills;
# .agents/.claude are convenience pointers recreated per machine (and consumers
# get the skills via `npx move skills`). Kept out of git so the repo doesn't
# ship fragile symlinks that break on Windows / show up empty on GitHub.
